# trunk: the closed list of states of the machine "Trunk line".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
clean	initial	rest	the tip of the trunk is verified
unverified	-	waiting	the tip holds commits that no verify has run on
verifying	-	active	a verify runs on the commits above the pin
red	-	waiting	a verify failed, and its commit is being reverted
